 r←Initial
 C←##.CommTools
 r←1 C.YesOrNo'Note: most test cases need a user for interactions',LF,'Would you like to carry out the tests anyway?'
 :If 1 C.YesOrNo'Execute API in #.CommTools.CommTools? (No=⎕SE.CommTools)'
     ∆Ref2CommTools←#.CommTools.CommTools
 :Else
     ∆Ref2CommTools←⎕SE.CommTools
 :EndIf
⍝Done
